abstract: "A partial analysis release for distinguishing within-rhythm HR selection from rhythm allocation under shared retention budgets. Includes CPU-only synthetic examples, fixed-set cluster bootstrap routines, aggregate result snapshots and official data-access guidance. No patient-level data or plotting code are redistributed."
